      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SE             WESTON TURVILLE         SCHOOL LANE                                              north side 5/333                                        Union Chapel                                              II Baptist Chapel, dated 1839. Red brick, painted stucco front, slate roof with projecting eaves, gabled to front, hipped to rear. 1 storey. Segmental arched doorway with recessed oak door flanked by sash windows. Octagonal window in gable with star pattern glazing. Side elevations have 2 bays of 5-pane wide sash windows with flat gauged brick arches. Small wing dated 1908 on N. side, asbestos roofed lean-to addition on S. side. Listing NGR: SP8540910591"
    }
